Scope. This license covers only the files this project adds on top of
pokeemerald-expansion (the "Platform Layer"): everything under platform/
and tests/, the native build files (Makefile.native, tools/build-native.sh
and the files they include that are not part of upstream
pokeemerald-expansion), the native input-replay and gate scripts, the
workflows native.yml, windows.yml and release.yml, the actions under
.github/actions/, .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/ and the files under
.github/release/, .clang-format and .clang-tidy, the files this project
added under test/ (crit_odds.c, gba_table_reads.c, malloc.c, siirtc.c and
trainer_util.c), and the documents README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/BUILDING.md, docs/C-RULES.md,
docs/DECISIONS.md, docs/RESEARCH.md, docs/RUNNING.md, docs/UPGRADING.md,
docs/UPSTREAM_MODIFICATIONS.md, docs/research/ and the first section of
CREDITS.md. It also covers the modifications this project made to upstream
files, which are listed in docs/UPSTREAM_MODIFICATIONS.md, to the extent
those modifications are separable from the upstream code.

